<title>USA: TTR Inc hires Robert Friedman as CFO.</title>
<headline>TTR Inc hires Robert Friedman as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>TTR Inc said it has named Robert Friedman as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Friedman was formerly employed at Oppenheimer &amp; Co's International Department, where he worked on the Israel Desk focusing on high-tech Israeli companies.</p>
